SET age = 25
WHERE id = 3;

DELETE FROM t1 
where id = 3;

Focus: Database setup and schema modifications.

Core Concepts Covered:

Schema creation and modification (CREATE DATABASE, USE, CREATE TABLE)

Altering tables, renaming columns, and modifying data types (ALTER TABLE, RENAME COLUMN, MODIFY COLUMN)

Managing constraints and key relationships (PRIMARY KEY, ADD CONSTRAINT, DROP PRIMARY KEY)

Performing core CRUD operations (INSERT INTO, UPDATE, DELETE, DROP TABLE)



